  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<div><p style=\"margin-right:-.9pt;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"color:black\">The forces acting on the block are shown. Since the block is not </span></p><p style=\"margin-right:-.9pt;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"color:black\">moving forward for the maximum force </span><i><span>F</span></i><span> applied, therefore </span></p><p style=\"margin-right:-.9pt;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>F</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>N</mi> </mrow> </math> </span><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &hellip;(i) (Horizontal Direction)</span></p><p style=\"margin-right:-.9pt;text-autospace:none\"><span>and &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>F</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi> </mrow> </math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&hellip;(ii)</span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-right:-.9pt;text-align:left;\"><span>From (i) and (ii)</span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-right:-.9pt;text-align:left;\"><span><img alt=\"\" height=\"215\" src=\"assets\\st0157_98cb7167ac2c.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" width=\"327\" /></span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-right:-.9pt;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>F</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mrow><mo>[</mo> <mrow> <mi>F</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi> </mrow> <mo>]</mo></mrow> </mrow> </math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-right:-.9pt;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> </span></p></div>"
